# Phase 8b-3 (docs/phase8b-brief.md 4.3, 7): every Settings row's panel
# for the side-by-sides against the owner's settings-NN-*.jpg photos
# (tests/review/p8b-sxs.txt): metallic tiles on the reflective surface,
# the Date & Time calendar page (no tile), the capacity capsule, the
# split shadow at the seam. The panel clock is pinned (Tuesday 6 Oct).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p8b-settings.script

wait 4000            # boot to the main menu
wheel +3             # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot about
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot shuffle
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot repeat
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot main_menu
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot music_menu
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot volume_limit
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot backlight
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot brightness
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot audiobooks
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot eq
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot sound_check
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot clicker
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot date_time
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot sort_by
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot language
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot legal
wheel +1 300
wait 900
shot reset_settings
quit
